    "NT_VERSE_SNIPPET": "She will bear a son... for he will save his people from their sins.",
    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Exodus 5:1 — “Let my people go, that they may hold a feast to me in the wilderness.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Matthew 1:21 — “She will bear a son... for he will save his people from their sins.”",
    "GREEK": "λαός",
